  "reasoning": "The conduct involves purchasing and selling high‑school exam cheating devices and promising to provide exam answers, which constitutes organizing and using cheating in examinations. Under Chinese criminal law this is charged as the crime of organizing and using exam cheating (组织、利用考试作弊). No other crimes such as illegal acquisition of state secrets apply to exam materials.",
